@host = http://localhost:5000

### Ca 1 - Kiem tra service (200)
GET {{host}}/

### Ca 2 - Lay danh sach bai tap (200)
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### Ca 3 - Tao luot nop (201 Created + Location)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200859",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/phamzduong-pixel/CNTTK23E"
}

### Ca 4 - Doc lai theo id cua Ca 3 (200)
# Goi lai sau khoang 2 giay de quan sat received -> processing -> graded.
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Ca 5 - Du lieu rong (400)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### Ca 6 - Assignment khong ton tai (404)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200859",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/phamzduong-pixel/CNTTK23E"
}

### Ca 7 - Submission khong ton tai (404)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Ca 8 - SignalR negotiate dung duong dan (200 + connectionId)
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### Ca 9 - SignalR negotiate sai duong dan (404)
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
